Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 06:19:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] presentation: fast scroller thumb stays grabbed while pressed
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Pressing the fast scroller faded the thumb out, and the same finger then
dragged the shelf backwards. The hit target was removed at alpha 0, so a
held finger that did not move stopped counting as a press.

The thumb now records the finger on the down event, before touch slop,
and stays opaque until that finger lifts. The hit rectangle stays up for
the whole press. List, grid, and panorama scrollers share that thumb.
Anikku still fades with FadeOutAnimationSpec, whose delay is the
platform scroll delay. Mihon's list and grid wait two seconds.

与 mihon-harmony 0027 同源. IrregularVerticalGridFastScroller is Anikku's
own fourth scroller, on the episode grid. It now uses the same 32 dp hit
target, press tracking, and opaque-while-held fade.
